spans.s:
--a sacrificial post;
1: वा. ३०. १४८; ९४. १७; ९७. २८; १०६. ४३.
circumambulation of the, leads to the fruit of वाजपेय;
2: Ib. १११. ३१-2.
in the Gaura hill on the banks of the Ganges where Indra made many sacrifices;
3: Br. II. १८. २८.
near ब्रह्मतीर्थ where ब्रह्मा performed sacrifice and planted a यूप.
4: वा. १११. ३१.
